        "zh": {
          "title": "芝加哥奧黑爾機場（ORD）航管人力不足，FAA一度暫停飛往當地的航班起飛",
          "summary": "因芝加哥近場航管人力不足，美國聯邦航空總署11月23日一度要求部分飛往奧黑爾國際機場的航班留在出發地，當天中午解除限制。",
          "body": [
            "美國聯邦航空總署（FAA）11月23日發布地面停飛通告，要求部分飛往芝加哥奧黑爾國際機場（ORD）的航班暫留出發地。措施涵蓋美國及加拿大部分航管區，並非暫停所有從奧黑爾機場起飛的航班。",
            "FAA在提供給NBC Chicago的聲明中，將原因歸於芝加哥終端雷達近場管制設施人力不足。FAA原訂措施實施至芝加哥當地時間中午12時15分，並於中午發布解除通告；NBC Chicago報導，限制解除後仍有部分離場航班延誤。"
          ]
        },
        "en": {
          "title": "FAA briefly holds Chicago O’Hare-bound flights over air traffic control staffing",
          "summary": "The FAA temporarily held some flights bound for Chicago O’Hare International Airport at their departure airports on November 23, citing staffing constraints. It lifted the ground stop around noon local time.",
          "body": [
            "The Federal Aviation Administration issued a ground stop on November 23 for some flights bound for Chicago O’Hare International Airport (ORD). It covered departures from parts of the United States and Canada; it did not ground all flights departing O’Hare.",
            "The FAA attributed the pause to staffing constraints at Chicago Terminal Radar Approach Control in a statement to NBC Chicago. The agency initially scheduled the restriction to run until 12:15 p.m. local time and issued a cancellation advisory around noon. NBC Chicago reported that some departure delays remained after the restriction was lifted."
          ]
        },
